4. Website mein SEO ke liye kya improve karna chahiye?
Maine website dekhte hue kuch important opportunities identify ki hain.

1. Dedicated service landing pages

Har major service ke liye proper SEO landing page hona chahiye. Sirf ek common Services page par 18 services list karne se har service ko sufficient topical focus nahi milta. 

Next-Gen Cloud Systems & Software Engineering

2. Location-based SEO

Lucknow company hone ke karan Lucknow-related searches par focus karna chahiye. Google Business Profile, genuine customer reviews aur consistent business contact details maintain karne chahiye.

3. Case studies improve karna

Existing projects jaise ChotU, ServiceHub aur Advance Transcription ko detailed case studies mein convert karna chahiye.

Har case study mein problem, solution, technologies used aur measurable results hone chahiye. 

Next-Gen Cloud Systems & Software Engineering

4. Brand consistency

Website par Verve Nova, Verve Nova Tech aur Verve Nova Technologies jaise different brand variations dikhte hain. Primary brand name consistently use karna chahiye.

5. Technical SEO

XML sitemap, robots.txt, canonical tags, structured data, mobile performance aur Google Search Console coverage properly check karna chahiye. Sitemap aur robots configuration main independently verify nahi kar paya.

