6. Ek important cheez — mujhe Google Search Console ka data chahiye
Abhi maine public Google search results ke basis par preliminary visibility check kiya hai. Actual keyword ranking report banane ke liye Google Search Console best rahega.

Google Search Console mein:

Performance → Search Results open karo.

Date range → Last 3 months select karo.

Queries tab open karo.

Export → Excel ya CSV kar do.

Us report se hum identify kar sakte hain:

Kaunse keywords already rank kar rahe hain.

Kis keyword ki average position kya hai.

Kin keywords par impressions aa rahe hain, lekin clicks nahi.

Kaunse keywords position 5–20 par hain jinhe push karke first page par la sakte hain.

Kaunse new keywords target karne chahiye.

Meri advice: Pehle Lucknow mein 5 primary keyword clusters par strong visibility build karein, uske baad India-wide AI, SaaS, CRM aur enterprise software keywords expand karein. Saari services ko ek saath target karne ke bajaye focused SEO campaign zyada practical rahega.

