One last important thing: Existing rankings
Website ki pages Google mein discover ho rahi hain, lekin live public search se har keyword ki exact ranking position establish nahi hoti. Main abhi kisi keyword ko confirmed ranking nahi bolunga.

Actual ranking baseline ke liye mujhe tumhari website ka Google Search Console Performance export (last 3 months) chahiye. Usse hum recommended keywords ko actual existing queries ke saath compare karke identify kar sakte hain ki kaunse keywords already rank kar rahe hain aur kaunse bilkul new hain.

Is strategy ko hum Verve Nova Tech ka working SEO keyword plan maan sakte hain.




